      "Here is the analysis of your RFM customer segmentation data:\n",
      "\n",
      "---\n",
      "\n",
      "**Segment: At Risk**\n",
      "*   **Key Insight:** Customers who previously demonstrated good frequency and monetary value are now showing a significant decline in recent activity, putting them at high risk of churn.\n",
      "*   **Customer Behavior:** These customers have a relatively high average frequency (3.82) and monetary value ($1641.4) (Avg_F_Score: 3.67, Avg_M_Score: 3.76) but have not purchased recently (Avg_Recency: 139.82 days, Avg_R_Score: 1.76).\n",
      "*   **Business Opportunity/Risk:** High risk of losing valuable customers and the 7.17% of total revenue they represent. Opportunity to reactivate them before they become 'Hibernating' or 'Lost'.\n",
      "*   **Recommended Actions:** Implement targeted re-engagement campaigns with personalized offers or incentives based on past purchases to encourage an immediate transaction. Conduct brief surveys to understand reasons for reduced recency.\n",
      "\n",
      "---\n",
      "\n",
      "**Segment: Champions**\n",
      "*   **Key Insight:** This segment consists of the most valuable and engaged customers, contributing the vast majority of the company's total revenue.\n",
      "*   **Customer Behavior:** These customers have purchased very recently (Avg_Recency: 12.49 days, Avg_R_Score: 4.59), purchase most frequently (Avg_Frequency: 12.7, Avg_F_Score: 4.7), and spend the most per transaction (Avg_Monetary: $7946.28, Avg_M_Score: 4.64).\n",
      "*   **Business Opportunity/Risk:** Significant opportunity to maximize their lifetime value and leverage their loyalty. Risk of neglecting them and potentially impacting the 70.41% of total revenue they generate.\n",
      "*   **Recommended Actions:** Establish VIP loyalty programs, offer exclusive early access to new products or sales, and request feedback or testimonials. Provide personalized product recommendations to maintain high engagement and spending.\n",
      "\n",
      "---\n",
      "\n",
      "**Segment: Hibernating**\n",
      "*   **Key Insight:** This is the largest segment by customer count, characterized by declining engagement across all RFM metrics, posing a risk of becoming lost if not re-engaged.\n",
      "*   **Customer Behavior:** They have not purchased recently (Avg_Recency: 98.76 days, Avg_R_Score: 2.58), purchase infrequently (Avg_Frequency: 1.83, Avg_F_Score: 2.29), and have a moderate average monetary value (Avg_Monetary: $931.11, Avg_M_Score: 2.56).\n",
      "*   **Business Opportunity/Risk:** Opportunity to reactivate a significant portion (25.68%) of the customer base, potentially reclaiming their 9.75% revenue contribution. Risk of these customers completely churning if left unaddressed.\n",
      "*   **Recommended Actions:** Design targeted re-engagement campaigns with compelling offers or new product showcases. Segment this group further based on their last purchase category to personalize outreach.\n",
      "\n",
      "---\n",
      "\n",
      "**Segment: Lost Customers**\n",
      "*   **Key Insight:** This large segment has effectively churned, showing minimal past value and virtually no recent engagement.\n",
      "*   **Customer Behavior:** They have not purchased for a very long time (Avg_Recency: 227.39 days, Avg_R_Score: 1.33), purchased very infrequently (Avg_Frequency: 1.04, Avg_F_Score: 1.45), and spent very little (Avg_Monetary: $228.79, Avg_M_Score: 1.41).\n",
      "*   **Business Opportunity/Risk:** Low opportunity for high-ROI re-engagement due to extremely low past value and high recency. Risk is minimal as they contribute only 1.78% of total revenue.\n",
      "*   **Recommended Actions:** Consider highly cost-effective, last-ditch win-back offers (e.g., deep discounts) with a clear ROI threshold. Utilize a small portion of this segment for churn surveys to gather insights for prevention.\n",
      "\n",
      "---\n",
      "\n",
      "**Segment: Loyal Customers**\n",
      "*   **Key Insight:** These customers are consistent and valuable, frequently purchasing and contributing significantly to revenue, but are not yet at the \"Champion\" level of engagement and spending.\n",
      "*   **Customer Behavior:** They purchase relatively recently (Avg_Recency: 38.45 days, Avg_R_Score: 3.45), frequently (Avg_Frequency: 5.29, Avg_F_Score: 4.3), and spend well (Avg_Monetary: $1979.91, Avg_M_Score: 3.8).\n",
      "*   **Business Opportunity/Risk:** Opportunity to nurture these customers to increase their monetary value and recency, potentially transitioning them into 'Champions'. Risk of stagnation or decline if not adequately appreciated and engaged.\n",
      "*   **Recommended Actions:** Offer personalized product recommendations to encourage higher average order values. Provide early access to sales or new product lines. Introduce tiered loyalty incentives to reward increased spending or frequency.\n",
      "\n",
      "---\n",
      "\n",
      "**Segment: New Customers**\n",
      "*   **Key Insight:** A small segment characterized by very recent and high-value initial purchases, but low frequency, indicating potential for growth if repeat purchases are stimulated.\n",
      "*   **Customer Behavior:** They have made a very recent purchase (Avg_Recency: 17.1 days, Avg_R_Score: 4.39) and spent well (Avg_Monetary: $1751.95, Avg_M_Score: 4.23), but have low purchase frequency (Avg_Frequency: 1.71, Avg_F_Score: 1.9).\n",
      "*   **Business Opportunity/Risk:** Significant opportunity to convert these customers into 'Loyal Customers' or 'Champions' by encouraging their second and subsequent purchases. Risk of losing their initial high value if not properly onboarded and engaged.\n",
      "*   **Recommended Actions:** Implement an immediate onboarding sequence (e.g., welcome emails, product usage tips). Offer incentives for a second purchase (e.g., a small discount, free shipping on their next order). Collect early feedback on their initial experience.\n",
      "\n",
      "---\n",
      "\n",
      "**Segment: Potential Loyalists**\n",
      "*   **Key Insight:** This segment has made recent purchases but with low frequency and low monetary value, making them good candidates for loyalty development with targeted interventions.\n",
      "*   **Customer Behavior:** They have purchased recently (Avg_Recency: 17.14 days, Avg_R_Score: 4.37) but have low frequency (Avg_Frequency: 1.65, Avg_F_Score: 2.17) and low average monetary value (Avg_Monetary: $389.22, Avg_M_Score: 1.99).\n",
      "*   **Business Opportunity/Risk:** Opportunity to develop this relatively large segment (11.5% of customers) into more valuable customers by increasing their frequency and average spend. Risk of them becoming 'Hibernating' or 'Lost' if not effectively engaged.\n",
      "*   **Recommended Actions:** Encourage repeat purchases within a short timeframe with targeted offers. Promote value bundles or higher-priced product options to increase average order value. Showcase benefits of becoming a loyal customer.\n"
