    "- Use ONLY the metrics provided.\n",
    "- Do not invent customer history, causes, demographics, products,\n",
    "  transactions, or business events.\n",
    "- Do not say a customer \"churned\" unless the data explicitly says churn.\n",
    "  Instead use phrases such as \"low recent activity\" or \"high recency\".\n",
    "- Do not claim \"per transaction\" because Monetary represents total\n",
    "  customer monetary value in this RFM analysis.\n",
